      <title>特朗普呼吁通过加密货币法案，美国监管走向引关注</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260819/%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E5%91%BC%E5%90%81%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%8A%A0%E5%AF%86%E8%B4%A7%E5%B8%81%E6%B3%95%E6%A1%88%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E7%9B%91%E7%AE%A1%E8%B5%B0%E5%90%91%E5%BC%95%E5%85%B3%E6%B3%A8/</link>
